  "body_html": "<p><em>“This town, is coming like a ghost town<br/>\nAll the clubs have been closed down”</em></p>\n<p>Financial District was really looking like a ghost town on this Halloween night. The power in most of downtown Manhattan is shut down (even though the <a href=\"http://www.mehanata.com/\">Bulgarian bar Mehanata</a> was working rain or shine or hurricane). Here are some photos.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/world-trade-center1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1346\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/world-trade-center1-168x300.jpg\" title=\"world trade center\" width=\"168\"/></a><a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/2.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1341\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/2-168x300.jpg\" title=\"2\" width=\"168\"/></a><a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/31.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1349\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/31-168x300.jpg\" title=\"3\" width=\"168\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/4.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1343\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/4-168x300.jpg\" title=\"4\" width=\"168\"/></a><a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/5.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1344\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/5-168x300.jpg\" title=\"5\" width=\"168\"/></a><a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/19.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1362\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/19-168x300.jpg\" title=\"19\" width=\"168\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://picasion.com/resize-gif\"><img alt=\"http://picasion.com/resize-gif/\" border=\"0\" height=\"253\" src=\"http://i.picasion.com/pic60/cea260db15a4e7519fe81baa0057abaa.gif\" width=\"450\"/></a><br/><a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/7.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1350\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/7-168x300.jpg\" title=\"7\" width=\"168\"/></a><a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/8.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1352\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/8-168x300.jpg\" title=\"8\" width=\"168\"/></a><a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/24-part.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1366\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/24-part-168x300.jpg\" title=\"24 part\" width=\"168\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/21.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1364\" height=\"575\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/21.jpg\" title=\"21\" width=\"1024\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/22.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1365\" height=\"575\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/22.jpg\" title=\"22\" width=\"1024\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/9.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-1353\" height=\"321\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.co