oads/2012/11/16.jpg\" title=\"16\" width=\"800\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/17.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1361\" height=\"575\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/17.jpg\" title=\"17\" width=\"1024\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/20.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1363\" height=\"575\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/20.jpg\" title=\"20\" width=\"1024\"/></a><br/>\n<em>And let’s thank the guys working hard to restore the normal life in the City!!!</em><strong><br/>\n<a href=\"http://picasion.com/resize-gif\"><img alt=\"http://picasion.com/resize-gif/\" border=\"0\" height=\"253\" src=\"http://i.picasion.com/pic60/85fb83d359576fa47ced794e6a9dd1f4.gif\" width=\"450\"/></a><br/><a href=\"http://www.picasion.com/resize-gif\">http://picasion.com/resize-gif/</a></strong></p>",
